" Docker Architecture "
--------------------
Docker Client ---> is responsible for to interacting user to docker daemon by using docker commands 
Docker Daemon ---> it is a heart of docker it manages all docker components -- images, containers, networking, volumes, compose, swarm 
Docker Registry ---> it will store all public and private images

user ---> by docker commands ---> docker client --- > docker daemon ---> docker registry 

Docker --- Docker engine --- Containers --- Image --- Dockerfile --- registry 

" OS - Level - Virtualization" ---> vm -- docker install - permission to exceute-- group and user add-- run containers --- install all -- take back by image --- by Docker Commit ""
