Dockerfile -- text file -- contains instructions to create a image -- based on application dependencies + libraries -- dev+ DevOps -- will create a dockerfile

Dockerfile components
FROM ---> taking from any base image instead of zero 
RUN ---> for executing the commands
CMD ---> same but while container runtime it will exceute
COPY ---> copying the local files to inside the container
ADD ---> any internet links i will copy to inside the container 
WORKDIR ---> it will create a folder and places
LABEL ---> it will tell the information of the image owner
ENV ---> by this we can set the variables insise the container
ENTRYPOINT ---> high preference to run the commands --- can't overide
EXPOSE ---> port number expose 
ARGS ---> it will give the outside container variables



