Docker compose
---> we can run 1 container in 1 server but if we want to eun mutliple container on 1 server --- then we need to use Docker Compose 

---> by installing docker compose -- by using docker-compose.yml -- we can list all services -- and run at a time 




Docker Networking 
---> Networking is imp to communicate with in the containers  --- one to one 

1. Bridge network---> it is the default network-- containers will communicate within the same host 

2. Overlay network ---> used to communicate across the multiple host

3. host network ---> if we want same ip for the container we can use it 

4. none network -- > when we dont want to expose outside the we can use none 



Docker Swarm 
